[TITLE]
IO-53: the model of IO-53_c1-first.inp with J2 and C2 listed first in their
sections. The inflow to J1 alternates between 1 and 3 cfs at every 30 s
routing step, and MAX_TRIALS 1 with HEAD_TOLERANCE 0.0001 ft makes
nonconvergence frequent.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             01:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:05:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
DRY_STEP             00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP         0:00:30
VARIABLE_STEP        0
MAX_TRIALS           1
HEAD_TOLERANCE       0.0001

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name  Elev  MaxDepth  InitDepth  SurDepth  Aponded
J2      9     5         0          0         0
J1      10    5         0          0         0

[OUTFALLS]
;;Name  Elev  Type
O1      8     FREE

[CONDUITS]
;;Name  From  To  Length  Roughness  InOffset  OutOffset  InitFlow
C2      J2    O1  200     0.013      0         0         0
C1      J1    J2  200     0.013      0         0         0

[XSECTIONS]
;;Link  Shape     Geom1  Geom2  Geom3  Geom4  Barrels
C2      CIRCULAR  1.5    0      0      0      1
C1      CIRCULAR  1.5    0      0      0      1

[INFLOWS]
;;Node  Constituent  TimeSeries  Type  Mfactor  Sfactor  Baseline
J1      FLOW         TS1         FLOW  1.0      1.0      0

